  "item_short_desc": "<p>Long-lasting and fully customizable, Rothco's Web Belts can easily be cut for the perfect fit (up to 44 inches long). The durable cotton canvas material is available in over a dozen belt and buckle options. Additional lengths (54\", 64\" and 74\") are also available, see matching items below.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "7281",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco's Web Belts. Constructed from resilient high-density cotton canvas, these belts are fully adjustable up to 44 inches. Easily customize the length by cutting for a perfect fit. The secure metal buckle ensures reliability, and the detachable buckle allows for personalized style. Measuring 1.25&rdquo; wide, these belts are versatile, fitting BDU pants, cargo shorts, uniforms, jeans, and more. With over a dozen buckle and webbing color options, these tough belts offer durability, functionality, and a touch of personalization.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
